 "4a6e12": {
  "svg": "<figure class=\"diagrama\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 626\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Distinção entre as modalidades legais de guarda e as figuras de uso prático nas varas de família.\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"626\" fill=\"#fff\" rx=\"18\"/><text x=\"380.0\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Modalidades de guarda</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"70\" width=\"332.0\" height=\"44\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"206.0\" y=\"99\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">Previstas no <a href=\"https://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/leis/2002/l10406compilada.htm\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"lei\">Código Civil</a></text><rect x=\"388.0\" y=\"70\" width=\"332.0\" height=\"44\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#24334a\"/><text x=\"554.0\" y=\"99\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">Construções doutrinárias e práticas</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"126\" width=\"332.0\" height=\"178\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"388.0\" y=\"126\" width=\"332.0\" height=\"178\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"56\" y=\"156\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">Compartilhada:</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">responsabilização conjunta e</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"208\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">exercício de direitos e</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"234\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">deveres por ambos (art.</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">1.583, § 1º); regra geral</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"286\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">(art. 1.584, § 2º)</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"156\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">Alternada: a criança alterna</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">residências por períodos, e</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"208\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">a decisão acompanha quem</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"234\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">está com ela — não se</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">confunde com a compartilhada</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"314\" width=\"332.0\" height=\"152\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"388.0\" y=\"314\" width=\"332.0\" height=\"152\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"56\" y=\"344\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">Unilateral: atribuída a um</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"370\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">só dos genitores ou a quem o</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"396\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">substitua (art. 1.583, §</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">1º); o outro supervisiona</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"448\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">(art. 1.583, § 5º)</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"344\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">Nidal (aninhamento): a</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"370\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">criança permanece na casa e</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"396\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">os pais se revezam</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"476\" width=\"332.0\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"388.0\" y=\"476\" width=\"332.0\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"56\" y=\"506\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">Tempo de convívio dividido</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"532\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">de forma equilibrada, não</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"558\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">necessariamente igual (art.</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"584\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">1.583, § 2º)</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"506\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">Guarda a terceiro: avós ou</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"532\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">outro familiar, quando os</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"558\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">pais não têm condições (art.</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"584\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">1.584, § 5º)</text></svg><figcaption>Distinção entre as modalidades legais de guarda e as figuras de uso prático nas varas de família.</figcaption></figure>",
  "lab": "Distinção entre as modalidades legais de guarda e as figuras de uso prático nas varas de família."
 },
 "03ac16": {
  "svg": "<figure class=\"diagrama\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 840\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Vícios mais frequentes que fundamentam impugnação, pedido de esclarecimentos ou nova perícia.\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"840\" fill=\"#fff\" rx=\"18\"/><text x=\"380.0\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Onde um laudo psicológico costuma falhar</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"70\" width=\"640\" height=\"100\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"100\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"107\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">1</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Método não descrito</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Sem indicar instrumentos, número de sessões, fontes e</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">procedimento — exigência da Res. CFP 06/2019, art. 11.</text><path d=\"M380.0 170 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 186 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"200\" width=\"640\" height=\"100\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"230\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"237\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">2</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"236\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Conclusão sem base nos dados</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Afirmação que não decorre do que foi coletado, ou que</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"292\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">extrapola o que a psicologia pode afirmar.</text><path d=\"M380.0 300 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 316 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"330\" width=\"640\" height=\"100\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"360\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"367\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">3</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"366\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Sinal isolado tratado como prova</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"396\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Um comportamento ou uma frase da criança lido fora do</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">contexto, sem leitura integrada.</text><path d=\"M380.0 430 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 446 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"460\" width=\"640\" height=\"100\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"490\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"497\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">4</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"496\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Uma só versão ouvida</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"526\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Perito que entrevista apenas uma das partes ou ignora</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"552\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">documentos dos autos.</text><path d=\"M380.0 560 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 576 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"590\" width=\"640\" height=\"100\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"620\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"627\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">5</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"626\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\"><a href=\"/quesitos-para-assistente-tecnico-psicologico/\">Quesitos</a> não respondidos</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"656\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Omissão ou resposta evasiva aos quesitos das partes</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"682\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">(CPC, art. 473, IV).</text><path d=\"M380.0 690 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 706 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"720\" width=\"640\" height=\"100\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"750\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"757\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">6</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"756\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Linguagem conclusiva sobre fatos</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"786\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Laudo que afirma que “houve abuso” ou “houve</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"812\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">alienação” — juízo de fato que cabe ao juiz.</text></svg><figcaption>Vícios mais frequentes que fundamentam impugnação, pedido de esclarecimentos ou nova perícia.</figcaption></figure>",
  "lab": "Vícios mais frequentes que fundamentam impugnação, pedido de esclarecimentos ou nova perícia."
 },
 "018eaf": {
  "svg": "<figure class=\"diagrama\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 722\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diferença de papel entre o perito nomeado pelo juízo e o assistente técnico indicado pela parte.\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"722\" fill=\"#fff\" rx=\"18\"/><text x=\"380.0\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Perito x Assistente técnico</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"70\" width=\"332.0\" height=\"44\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"206.0\" y=\"99\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">Perito (do juízo)</text><rect x=\"388.0\" y=\"70\" width=\"332.0\" height=\"44\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#24334a\"/><text x=\"554.0\" y=\"99\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">Assistente técnico (da parte)</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"126\" width=\"332.0\" height=\"74\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"388.0\" y=\"126\" width=\"332.0\" height=\"74\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"56\" y=\"156\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">Nomeado pelo juiz (CPC, art.</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">465)</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"156\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">Indicado pela parte em 15</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">dias (art. 465, § 1º, II)</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"210\" width=\"332.0\" height=\"100\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"388.0\" y=\"210\" width=\"332.0\" height=\"100\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"56\" y=\"240\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">Deve ser imparcial; sujeito</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">a impedimento e suspeição</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"292\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">(art. 467)</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"240\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">Atua no interesse da parte;</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">não está sujeito a</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"292\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">impedimento (art. 466, § 1º)</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"320\" width=\"332.0\" height=\"74\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"388.0\" y=\"320\" width=\"332.0\" height=\"74\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"56\" y=\"350\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">Produz o laudo pericial</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"350\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">Produz parecer técnico sobre</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"376\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">o laudo (art. 477, § 1º)</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"404\" width=\"332.0\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"388.0\" y=\"404\" width=\"332.0\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"56\" y=\"434\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">Realiza a avaliação direta</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"460\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">das pessoas</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"434\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">Analisa autos, documentos e</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"460\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">gravações; não avalia a</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"486\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">parte contrária (Res. CFP</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"512\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">08/2010)</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"540\" width=\"332.0\" height=\"74\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"388.0\" y=\"540\" width=\"332.0\" height=\"74\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"56\" y=\"570\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">Responde a esclarecimentos</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"596\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">(art. 477, § 2º)</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"570\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">Aponta lacunas, contradições</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"596\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">e desvios de método</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"624\" width=\"332.0\" height=\"74\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"388.0\" y=\"624\" width=\"332.0\" height=\"74\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"56\" y=\"654\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">Honorários fixados pelo juiz</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"680\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">(art. 465, § 3º)</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"654\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">Honorários pagos pela parte</text><text x=\"404.0\" y=\"680\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\">que o indicou</text></svg><figcaption>Diferença de papel entre o perito nomeado pelo juízo e o assistente técnico indicado pela parte.</figcaption></figure>",
  "lab": "Diferença de papel entre o perito nomeado pelo juízo e o assistente técnico indicado pela parte."
 },
 "917e80": {
  "svg": "<figure class=\"diagrama\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 840\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Sequência prevista na Lei 13.431/2017 para a escuta protegida e o ponto em que entra a análise técnica.\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"840\" fill=\"#fff\" rx=\"18\"/><text x=\"380.0\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Rito do depoimento especial (Lei 13.431/2017)</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"70\" width=\"640\" height=\"126\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"100\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"107\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">1</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Antes da oitiva</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Criança ou adolescente é acolhido em local reservado,</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">sem contato com o suposto autor (art. 10 e art. 12,</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"188\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">I).</text><path d=\"M380.0 196 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 212 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"226\" width=\"640\" height=\"126\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"256\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">2</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"262\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Sala de depoimento especial</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"292\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Ambiente separado da sala de audiência, com</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"318\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">transmissão em tempo real para as partes (art. 11,</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"344\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">caput, e art. 12, III).</text><path d=\"M380.0 352 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 368 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"382\" width=\"640\" height=\"126\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"412\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"419\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">3</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"418\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Entrevista por profissional capacitado</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"448\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Relato livre, seguido de perguntas conforme protocolo;</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"474\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">perguntas das partes passam pelo juiz (art. 12, II e</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"500\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">V).</text><path d=\"M380.0 508 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 524 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"538\" width=\"640\" height=\"126\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"568\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"575\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">4</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"574\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Gravação integral</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"604\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Áudio e vídeo preservados e juntados aos autos; o</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"630\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">depoimento não é repetido, em regra (art. 11, § 2º, e</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"656\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">art. 12, V e VI).</text><path d=\"M380.0 664 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 680 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"694\" width=\"640\" height=\"126\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"724\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"731\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">5</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"730\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Análise técnica posterior</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"760\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">O assistente técnico examina a gravação: aderência ao</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"786\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">protocolo, sugestionabilidade e consistência do</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"812\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">relato.</text></svg><figcaption>Sequência prevista na Lei 13.431/2017 para a escuta protegida e o ponto em que entra a análise técnica.</figcaption></figure>",
  "lab": "Sequência prevista na Lei 13.431/2017 para a escuta protegida e o ponto em que entra a análise técnica."
 },
 "6db801": {
  "svg": "<figure class=\"diagrama\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 762\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Etapas usuais do estudo psicossocial nas varas de família e o momento da análise técnica pela parte.\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"762\" fill=\"#fff\" rx=\"18\"/><text x=\"380.0\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Como é feito o estudo psicossocial</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"70\" width=\"640\" height=\"126\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"100\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"107\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">1</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Determinação judicial</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">O juiz encaminha o caso à equipe técnica (psicólogo</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">e/ou assistente social) da vara ou nomeia</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"188\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">profissional.</text><path d=\"M380.0 196 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 212 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"226\" width=\"640\" height=\"126\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"256\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">2</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"262\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Entrevistas</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"292\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Genitores, criança ou adolescente e, quando</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"318\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">necessário, outros familiares e a rede (escola,</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"344\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">saúde).</text><path d=\"M380.0 352 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 368 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"382\" width=\"640\" height=\"100\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"412\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"419\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">3</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"418\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Visita domiciliar e documentos</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"448\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Observação das condições de moradia e rotina; leitura</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"474\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">dos autos e de documentos relevantes.</text><path d=\"M380.0 482 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 498 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"512\" width=\"640\" height=\"100\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"542\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"549\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">4</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"548\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Relatório ou laudo</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"578\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Síntese das informações, análise e conclusões</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"604\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">técnicas, sem decidir a guarda — quem decide é o juiz.</text><path d=\"M380.0 612 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 628 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"642\" width=\"640\" height=\"100\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"672\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"679\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">5</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"678\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Manifestação das partes</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"708\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Advogado e assistente técnico apontam omissões,</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"734\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">contradições ou falhas de método antes da sentença.</text></svg><figcaption>Etapas usuais do estudo psicossocial nas varas de família e o momento da análise técnica pela parte.</figcaption></figure>",
  "lab": "Etapas usuais do estudo psicossocial nas varas de família e o momento da análise técnica pela parte."
 },
 "df3e83": {
  "svg": "<figure class=\"diagrama\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 892\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Fluxo da perícia psicológica no processo civil, com os prazos do Código de Processo Civil.\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"892\" fill=\"#fff\" rx=\"18\"/><text x=\"380.0\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Etapas da perícia psicológica judicial (CPC, arts. 465 a 477)</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"70\" width=\"640\" height=\"100\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"100\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"107\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">1</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Nomeação do perito</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">O juiz nomeia o perito e fixa prazo para o laudo (art.</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">465, caput).</text><path d=\"M380.0 170 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 186 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"200\" width=\"640\" height=\"100\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"230\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"237\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">2</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"236\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">15 dias para as partes</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Arguir impedimento/suspeição, indicar assistente</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"292\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">técnico e apresentar <a href=\"/kit-de-quesitos/\">quesitos</a> (art. 465, § 1º).</text><path d=\"M380.0 300 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 316 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"330\" width=\"640\" height=\"126\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"360\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"367\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">3</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"366\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Diligências e avaliação</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"396\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Entrevistas, testes e análise documental; as partes e</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">os assistentes podem acompanhar (art. 466, § 2º, e</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"448\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">art. 474).</text><path d=\"M380.0 456 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 472 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"486\" width=\"640\" height=\"100\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"516\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"523\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">4</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"522\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Entrega do laudo</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"552\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">No prazo fixado pelo juiz, ao menos 20 dias antes da</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"578\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">audiência de instrução (art. 477, caput).</text><path d=\"M380.0 586 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 602 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"616\" width=\"640\" height=\"100\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"646\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"653\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">5</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"652\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Parecer do assistente técnico</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"682\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Partes intimadas; assistentes têm 15 dias para</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"708\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">apresentar parecer (art. 477, § 1º).</text><path d=\"M380.0 716 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 732 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"746\" width=\"640\" height=\"126\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"776\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"783\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">6</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"782\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Esclarecimentos e decisão</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"812\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Perito responde a divergências em 15 dias (art. 477,</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"838\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">§§ 2º e 3º); o juiz não fica adstrito ao laudo (art.</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"864\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">479).</text></svg><figcaption>Fluxo da perícia psicológica no processo civil, com os prazos do <a href=\"https://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/_ato2015-2018/2015/lei/l13105.htm\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"lei\">Código de Processo Civil</a>.</figcaption></figure>",
  "lab": "Fluxo da perícia psicológica no processo civil, com os prazos do Código de Processo Civil."
 },
 "8b2e08": {
