 fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"330\" width=\"640\" height=\"126\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"360\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"367\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">3</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"366\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Diligências e avaliação</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"396\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Entrevistas, testes e análise documental; as partes e</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">os assistentes podem acompanhar (art. 466, § 2º, e</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"448\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">art. 474).</text><path d=\"M380.0 456 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 472 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"486\" width=\"640\" height=\"100\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"516\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"523\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">4</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"522\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Entrega do laudo</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"552\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">No prazo fixado pelo juiz, ao menos 20 dias antes da</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"578\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">audiência de instrução (art. 477, caput).</text><path d=\"M380.0 586 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 602 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"616\" width=\"640\" height=\"100\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"646\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"653\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">5</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"652\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Parecer do assistente técnico</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"682\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Partes intimadas; assistentes têm 15 dias para</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"708\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">apresentar parecer (art. 477, § 1º).</text><path d=\"M380.0 716 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 732 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"746\" width=\"640\" height=\"126\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"776\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"783\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">6</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"782\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Esclarecimentos e decisão</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"812\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Perito responde a divergências em 15 dias (art. 477,</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"838\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">§§ 2º e 3º); o juiz não fica adstrito ao laudo (art.</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"864\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">479).</text></svg><figcaption>Fluxo da perícia psicológica no processo civil, com os prazos do <a href=\"https://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/_ato2015-2018/2015/lei/l13105.htm\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"lei\">Código de Processo Civil</a>.</figcaption></figure>",
