 "ff31c6": {
  "svg": "<figure class=\"diagrama\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 840\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Vícios mais frequentes que fundamentam impugnação, pedido de esclarecimentos ou nova perícia.\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"840\" fill=\"#fff\" rx=\"18\"/><text x=\"380.0\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Onde um laudo psicológico costuma falhar</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"70\" width=\"640\" height=\"100\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"100\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"107\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">1</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Método não descrito</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Sem indicar instrumentos, número de sessões, fontes e</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">procedimento — exigência da Res. CFP 06/2019, art. 11.</text><path d=\"M380.0 170 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 186 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"200\" width=\"640\" height=\"100\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"230\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"237\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">2</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"236\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Conclusão sem base nos dados</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Afirmação que não decorre do que foi coletado, ou que</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"292\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">extrapola o que a psicologia pode afirmar.</text><path d=\"M380.0 300 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 316 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"330\" width=\"640\" height=\"100\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"360\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"367\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">3</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"366\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Sinal isolado tratado como prova</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"396\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Um comportamento ou uma frase da criança lido fora do</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">contexto, sem leitura integrada.</text><path d=\"M380.0 430 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 446 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"460\" width=\"640\" height=\"100\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"490\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"497\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">4</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"496\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Uma só versão ouvida</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"526\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Perito que entrevista apenas uma das partes ou ignora</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"552\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">documentos dos autos.</text><path d=\"M380.0 560 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 576 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"590\" width=\"640\" height=\"100\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"620\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"627\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">5</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"626\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Quesitos não respondidos</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"656\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Omissão ou resposta evasiva aos quesitos das partes</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"682\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">(CPC, art. 473, IV).</text><path d=\"M380.0 690 l0 22\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M372.0 706 l8 10 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"720\" width=\"640\" height=\"100\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#FBF8F1\" stroke=\"#A66F3E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"750\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#18222f\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"757\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#F3EEE7\">6</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"756\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#18222f\">Linguagem conclusiva sobre fatos</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"786\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">Laudo que afirma que “houve abuso” ou “houve</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"812\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#566173\">alienação” — juízo de fato que cabe ao juiz.</text></svg><figcaption>Vícios mais frequentes que fundamentam impugnação, pedido de esclarecimentos ou nova perícia.</figcaption></figure>",
  "lab": "Vícios mais frequentes que fundamentam impugnação, pedido de esclarecimentos ou nova perícia."
 },
 "66292e": {
